/-! ## §2 — WELD 1 (P1 ⊗ P2): the mass scale is anchored on the DERIVED minimal-wrap amplitude. -/

/-- ★ WELD 1 (P1 ⊗ P2, never co-stated). The absolute mass scale (P2/N427 `massScale`, the arc-O O2
    derived chain) is anchored on the P1 minimal-wrap amplitude (N426 `minimalWrapRatio`), NOT on a
    posited scale: `massScale = minimalWrapRatio · ((cutCos foldPhase · s1BornProb) · 1 · cutCos(2/3))`.
    The proof welds the P2/N417 chain factorization `absScaleChainDerived_eq_anchor_mul` with the P1
    transmutation identity `minimalWrapRatio_eq_ewClosureRatio` — the whole mass tower routes through
    the DERIVED transmutation exponent `e^(−28π/3)`, not a free anchor. Physics-words-removable: a
    distinguished `Cut` factors through the `cutExp` amplitude times a product of derived cosines and
    the banked survival fraction. -/
theorem massScale_anchored_on_wrap :
    Phys.Algebra.AbsMass.massScale
      = minimalWrapRatio * ((cutCos foldPhase * ((s1BornProb : ℚ) : Cut)) * 1 * cutCos (2 / 3)) := by
  show Phys.Algebra.DischargeArcM.absScaleChainDerived
      = minimalWrapRatio * ((cutCos foldPhase * ((s1BornProb : ℚ) : Cut)) * 1 * cutCos (2 / 3))
  rw [minimalWrapRatio_eq_ewClosureRatio]
  exact Phys.Algebra.DischargeArcM.absScaleChainDerived_eq_anchor_mul

/-! ## §3 — WELD 2 (P3 ⊗ P6): the triality cycle order IS the derived colour/generation count. -/

/-- ★ WELD 2 (P3 ⊗ P6, never co-stated). The triality generation-cycle order IS the derived
    colour/generation count `finrank ℚ Uhol`: `trialityHom gcyc ^ (finrank ℚ Uhol) = 1 ∧
